      <div id="cvRegimeBadge" style="padding:0.35rem 0.85rem; border-radius:999px; font-weight:700; font-size:0.85rem; background:#10b981; color:#fff;">SUB-CRITICAL TURBULENT (NO CHOKING)</div>
